              "source": "PubMed",
              "id": "31981617"
            }
          ],
          "value": "Shows competitive inhibition of GHBDH activity by the product succinic semialdehyde, and non-competitive inhibitions by the three other substrate-product combinations. The conversion of GHB to SSA is activated by two different saturating purified nudix hydrolases, B.methanolicus activator ACT and E.coli NudF. The nudix hydrolases do not activate the reverse reaction"
        }
